# Webshare proxy list — one per line
# Format: host:port:username:password
#
# Copy to webshare.txt and fill in credentials:
#   cp proxies/webshare.txt.example proxies/webshare.txt
#
# Example (replace with your Webshare dashboard values):
# 31.56.127.193:7684:YOUR_USER:YOUR_PASS
# 198.23.243.226:6361:YOUR_USER:YOUR_PASS
